WEBVTT

00:08.560 --> 00:11.510
Anyway, they seem to be alive.

00:13.170 --> 00:16.770
Good thing Yue and Tio are back
to their original form.

00:17.820 --> 00:20.930
Now it's a problem of their
getting out of there on their own...

00:25.920 --> 00:27.460
But I guess it won't be a problem.

00:35.530 --> 00:37.060
Come back soon...

00:37.500 --> 00:38.430
Yue.

00:39.120 --> 00:42.180
I really want to hear your voice now.

01:04.650 --> 01:06.640
Welcome back, Yue.

01:08.010 --> 01:14.640
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

02:37.010 --> 02:42.020
A DEVILISH TRIAL

02:45.020 --> 02:46.350
How are you feeling?

02:47.380 --> 02:48.610
Hajime?

02:48.610 --> 02:50.410
Yeah, it's me.

02:50.410 --> 02:52.270
The real Hajime?

02:52.270 --> 02:54.310
Wonder why you'd ask that.

02:54.790 --> 02:56.740
Though, I think I know the reason.

02:58.980 --> 03:00.990
You decide yourself.

03:01.690 --> 03:05.190
Is the one in front of you
the real Hajime,

03:05.190 --> 03:06.830
or a fake one?

03:09.230 --> 03:10.930
By the way,

03:11.370 --> 03:14.590
I'm certain the Yue
I'm holding in my arms now,

03:14.590 --> 03:17.010
is the real deal.

03:23.040 --> 03:25.370
How did I look over there?

03:25.370 --> 03:28.700
You looked too good
in my school's uniform.

03:30.210 --> 03:32.670
I'll wear it for you next time.

03:32.670 --> 03:34.260
Can't wait for that.

03:34.770 --> 03:35.990
What about you?

03:35.990 --> 03:37.320
Ahem!

03:37.320 --> 03:40.300
You looked too good in
ceremonial clothes and on a throne.

03:40.300 --> 03:43.830
Sorry, never mind ceremonial clothes,
I can't sit on a throne.

03:44.190 --> 03:45.820
Wait, why a throne?

03:47.010 --> 03:48.750
We were a married royal couple.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.540
We already had eleven kids.

03:51.540 --> 03:52.970
A soccer team family?!

03:55.450 --> 03:57.720
Ahem! Uh-hum!

03:57.720 --> 04:00.970
Eh-heh-hem! Uh-heh-hum!

04:00.970 --> 04:02.670
Achoo!

04:03.390 --> 04:04.380
Huh?

04:04.810 --> 04:05.630
What?

04:08.740 --> 04:11.430
I'm just an unwanted girl, anyway...

04:11.430 --> 04:15.190
I worked hard to snap back to reality,
but reality is just too cruel...

04:15.590 --> 04:19.160
I even tried clearing my throat to get
your attention as to not disturb you...

04:24.170 --> 04:27.020
These rabbit ears are
really your identity, Shea.

04:27.020 --> 04:28.990
You're Shea with the rabbit ears.

04:28.990 --> 04:31.310
No rabbit ears means no Shea.

04:31.310 --> 04:33.290
I guess you are rabbit
ears themselves, Shea.

04:33.290 --> 04:35.250
I don't get you.

04:35.250 --> 04:38.710
My rabbit ears aren't
my whole body, mind you.

04:38.710 --> 04:40.740
What did you dream of, Shea?

04:41.970 --> 04:44.740
I dreamed that I never
got summoned to this world,

04:44.740 --> 04:48.530
and lived a peaceful life
with you and Yue.

04:48.530 --> 04:50.220
That was my dream.

04:50.220 --> 04:55.290
In my dream, my family wasn't
being chased, and I met you all,

04:55.290 --> 04:57.650
then we were living together.

04:58.260 --> 05:01.690
I was fine with only being protected.

05:02.220 --> 05:05.580
But that's not who I am,
and my heart screamed inside.

05:06.110 --> 05:09.600
When I came to, I chose to fight.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.690
By your side.

05:12.100 --> 05:14.230
So that's how you could return?

05:14.230 --> 05:17.830
Yes! From now on,
I want to stand next to you,

05:17.830 --> 05:20.710
and also you, Miss Yue.

05:20.710 --> 05:25.260
Even if that path is
filled with pain and suffering.

05:29.180 --> 05:32.080
Um... Mister Hajime?

05:32.080 --> 05:35.630
Well, welcome back, Shea.

05:35.630 --> 05:37.280
Glad you could make it back.

05:37.600 --> 05:40.860
Yes! I'm back, yes!

05:43.240 --> 05:44.750
Hajime.

05:49.330 --> 05:55.010
Rraagh! Master's spanking
is not that lukewarm!

05:55.010 --> 05:56.960
Go back to your training!

05:58.170 --> 06:00.660
Master!

06:01.010 --> 06:05.780
I am back! Love me!

06:10.230 --> 06:12.410
What is it, Master?

06:12.410 --> 06:14.740
Have you fallen for me?

06:22.170 --> 06:24.980
If you want me to fall for you,
then don't force a smile.

06:24.980 --> 06:28.490
Your perverted face is miles better.

06:30.970 --> 06:32.310
Anyway...

06:33.120 --> 06:34.830
Welcome back, Tio.

06:36.900 --> 06:40.250
Yes. I am back, Master.

06:41.710 --> 06:44.300
No, Hajime!

06:45.950 --> 06:49.740
That was, um... Well...

06:50.160 --> 06:53.980
Anyway, it's not like that!
I didn't mean to avoid you!

06:54.380 --> 06:56.710
That's fine...

06:56.710 --> 06:59.150
It must be something
about your dream, right?

06:59.150 --> 07:00.900
What did you see?

07:02.010 --> 07:03.950
What, you ask...

07:09.390 --> 07:11.490
Kaori's a big pervert.

07:11.490 --> 07:14.410
I'm not!

07:15.680 --> 07:19.020
Our group has all returned now...

07:19.020 --> 07:21.210
What about the hero and the others?

07:21.210 --> 07:25.840
Well, want to wait until they
can get out on their own?

07:26.190 --> 07:28.180
For how long?

07:28.180 --> 07:31.950
I guess until we get to eat lunch.

07:31.950 --> 07:35.110
I used up my mana trying to escape.

07:35.110 --> 07:36.770
I'd love to get some rest.

07:42.670 --> 07:44.940
I guess it's about time now.

07:44.940 --> 07:46.690
You're right.

07:46.690 --> 07:50.370
Right. We must put a stop to this,
or there'll be no end to it.

07:52.540 --> 07:55.710
That amber... It's Shizuku!

07:56.400 --> 07:59.010
I knew Yaegashi would be first.

07:59.010 --> 08:01.970
Shizuku is a strong one, after all.

08:01.970 --> 08:04.130
It is only reasonable.

08:08.500 --> 08:09.570
Where am I...

08:10.190 --> 08:11.360
Kaori?

08:11.360 --> 08:14.060
Yeah, it's me, Shizuku.

08:14.620 --> 08:15.830
Welcome back.

08:17.090 --> 08:19.710
Oh, so I came back...

08:21.230 --> 08:23.040
I feel so tired...

08:23.040 --> 08:24.860
You really overslept there.

08:25.940 --> 08:28.490
But, good thing you could overcome it.

08:28.870 --> 08:32.240
Huh? Nagumo...

08:32.660 --> 08:35.470
R-Right. It's a good thing.

08:37.130 --> 08:39.960
Shizuku, what dream did you have?

08:40.270 --> 08:42.800
What, you ask?

08:42.800 --> 08:45.660
Just a normal dream.
Nothing weird at all.

08:45.660 --> 08:48.380
It was completely normal.

08:48.380 --> 08:51.050
Normal? Who showed up there?

08:52.650 --> 08:56.470
It's everyone!
Everyone was there!

08:57.340 --> 08:58.420
I see.

09:01.930 --> 09:04.790
I can't be a princess...

09:04.790 --> 09:07.520
Besides, why did he have
to be the prince...

09:09.630 --> 09:11.280
I'm counting on you, Kaori.

09:11.280 --> 09:14.220
Don't dismantle their bodies too.

09:14.220 --> 09:15.740
Don't worry.

09:16.310 --> 09:20.540
I don't have to worry about losing control
if I'm not in a real battle.

09:22.160 --> 09:23.190
Dismantle.

09:28.560 --> 09:31.450
Huh? Kaori? Shizuku?

09:31.940 --> 09:33.590
I'm sure I was with you two...

09:35.180 --> 09:36.590
Where are we?

09:36.990 --> 09:38.270
I remember doing...

09:38.890 --> 09:40.170
Eri?!

09:40.170 --> 09:41.590
Huh?

09:41.590 --> 09:44.360
Um, where's Eri?

09:45.680 --> 09:46.940
Suzu...

09:47.820 --> 09:50.360
Well, it is what it is.

09:52.640 --> 09:54.330
Are you three okay?

09:55.220 --> 09:58.950
Amanogawa, Taneguchi,
there's no time to contemplate.

10:01.270 --> 10:02.420
Get ready.

10:02.420 --> 10:06.630
Or your wishes will literally fall apart.

10:07.040 --> 10:08.910
R-Right...

10:09.430 --> 10:10.300
I got it.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.220
Yeah.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.760
Looks like everyone's present
and accounted for.

10:29.760 --> 10:31.490
Hajime, are there any impostors?

10:32.010 --> 10:34.150
No, we're good.

10:34.590 --> 10:38.150
This does not sit right with me.

10:38.150 --> 10:42.080
It's just like when we were
ambushed in the Orcus Labyrinth.

10:42.080 --> 10:45.460
I sure don't sense any monsters around...

10:45.830 --> 10:49.670
I refuse to believe nothing will happen now.

10:51.570 --> 10:52.630
Rain?

10:52.630 --> 10:55.600
You're right. It's pouring.

10:56.090 --> 10:57.850
- But we're in a big tree!
- But we're in a big tree!

10:58.710 --> 10:59.310
Yue!

10:59.910 --> 11:01.060
Hallowed Ground!

11:09.020 --> 11:10.770
Nagumo, our perimeter...

11:11.140 --> 11:12.480
A slime, huh?

11:12.480 --> 11:16.200
Even my Demon Eye can't detect it...
What a stealth ability!

11:17.010 --> 11:19.120
Nagumo, it's coming from below!

11:20.190 --> 11:22.750
How dare you! Dismantle!

11:24.500 --> 11:27.700
Hey! Stop strangling me!

11:29.840 --> 11:31.630
Ryutaro, you idiot!

11:31.630 --> 11:33.710
He went at it full force!

11:36.580 --> 11:40.910
My whole body's slimy...
Gross...

11:48.710 --> 11:49.950
Good grief!

11:49.950 --> 11:52.150
Are you okay, Shizu...

11:52.570 --> 11:54.950
Yeah, I'm okay, Koki.

11:55.390 --> 11:57.680
This thing surprisingly dies easily.

11:57.680 --> 11:59.490
What's wrong?

11:59.490 --> 12:00.400
Huh...

12:00.900 --> 12:01.830
Well...

12:01.830 --> 12:05.090
It's nothing! Don't mind me!

12:38.780 --> 12:42.120
Tch, I should kick their
memories off them later.

12:46.430 --> 12:50.930
Yue, keep up the barrier.
I'll burn everything at every side.

12:50.930 --> 12:52.460
Got it.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.420
How dare you...

12:58.420 --> 13:02.200
...make them all slimy and dirty!

13:04.750 --> 13:07.030
It's a nice burn, if I say so myself.

13:07.030 --> 13:08.790
Can I take off the barrier?

13:08.790 --> 13:11.310
No, keep it up for some more.

13:13.790 --> 13:14.980
Yue?

13:28.060 --> 13:28.660
Yue?

13:30.880 --> 13:32.330
Hajime...

13:35.580 --> 13:38.500
Hajime, I feel strange...

13:38.500 --> 13:42.020
I want you so much...

13:42.980 --> 13:47.030
Hey, Yue. What are you
saying in this situation...

13:47.030 --> 13:48.470
What's gotten into you?

13:51.660 --> 13:56.190
Mister Hajime, I can't take it anymore...

13:56.190 --> 13:58.020
Hang on.

13:58.500 --> 13:59.610
Don't tell me...

14:02.730 --> 14:05.320
Hajime, I...

14:11.700 --> 14:14.480
Like hell I'd succumb to this.

14:15.460 --> 14:18.880
Damn! Is this the essence of that slime?

14:24.010 --> 14:26.310
Master, are you fine?

14:26.310 --> 14:30.880
Seems like the monster's mucus
turned out to be a powerful aphrodisiac.

14:31.820 --> 14:35.600
It has a strong pleasure effect,
it even blocks magic.

14:35.600 --> 14:40.880
What is troublesome is if this is not a physical
side effect from bathing in the mucus,

14:40.880 --> 14:43.360
but if it is a mental side effect.

14:43.360 --> 14:47.870
Well, it will take some time, but they will
surely overcome this with their mental fortitude.

14:47.870 --> 14:50.910
Hey, how are you still okay?

14:50.910 --> 14:51.870
Hm?

14:51.870 --> 14:55.920
If I recall correctly, you're the one
bathing in the mucus most.

14:56.390 --> 14:57.980
This is too unfunny to be a skit.

14:57.980 --> 15:01.220
The effect of the mucus
is also manifesting in my body.

15:01.220 --> 15:01.990
The truth is,

15:01.990 --> 15:06.590
my body is overflowing with pleasure,
it is hindering me from using magic.

15:06.590 --> 15:10.330
But you shan't make light of me, Master.

15:10.330 --> 15:12.750
Who do you think I am?

15:12.750 --> 15:13.600
Tio...

15:13.600 --> 15:16.550
I am your servant!

15:16.550 --> 15:21.650
This pleasure is nothing compared
to the pain you always give me!

15:21.650 --> 15:24.820
It is just too lukewarm!

15:25.260 --> 15:27.850
I see...
That's Miss Tio for ya.

15:27.850 --> 15:31.580
I mean, Miss Klarus.
Truly the best of the best.

15:31.580 --> 15:34.080
Anyway, could you stay away from me?

15:34.080 --> 15:37.540
Why are you speaking formally?!
And you are calling me by my family name too!

15:37.540 --> 15:39.790
This is too much estrangement!

15:40.320 --> 15:44.070
I cannot believe you are treating me
as a stranger at a time like this!

15:44.070 --> 15:45.670
Oh, no!

15:45.670 --> 15:48.500
- I am drowning in pleasure...
- Yue, Shea, Kaori.

15:48.500 --> 15:52.220
There's no way you'd let
a mere monster control you.

15:52.780 --> 15:55.950
You should still have
your right minds intact.

15:56.830 --> 15:57.770
Of course.

15:58.070 --> 16:00.880
You know me!

16:00.880 --> 16:03.320
Don't worry, I get you.

16:04.000 --> 16:07.500
Perhaps it'll be difficult
to resolve this with magic.

16:07.500 --> 16:10.420
But we have holy water.

16:10.850 --> 16:12.160
Want to try it.

16:12.160 --> 16:13.970
I don't need it.

16:13.970 --> 16:14.980
No need.

16:14.980 --> 16:16.130
Nope.

16:23.120 --> 16:26.810
In the end, only Yue, me,

16:26.810 --> 16:30.390
Shea, Tio, and Yaegashi
who could withstand it...

16:31.570 --> 16:33.550
Nagumo, um...

16:34.150 --> 16:35.550
Sorry for the trouble.

16:36.180 --> 16:39.440
You saved my bacon. Thanks.

16:42.140 --> 16:45.990
Suzu, forget it.
You couldn't help it.

16:45.990 --> 16:47.900
Shizushizu...

16:48.310 --> 16:52.230
I guess we're in an underground space.

16:52.230 --> 16:55.350
Of the big tree?

16:55.350 --> 16:58.750
So we're in the underground
space of the big tree?

16:58.750 --> 17:02.330
But then the big tree
we saw on the surface...

17:02.330 --> 17:07.180
So this is truly the big tree of Uralt.

17:07.180 --> 17:10.020
If branches grow from the underground trunk,

17:10.020 --> 17:13.010
that means the real root
is deeper below.

17:13.750 --> 17:16.340
Which means what we saw on the surface...

17:16.340 --> 17:19.480
...was only the tip of the tree.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.750
I guess that is the case.

17:22.810 --> 17:26.280
I cannot believe this is just a part of it.

17:26.720 --> 17:29.090
So how big...

17:29.090 --> 17:30.320
...is this thing actually?

17:34.530 --> 17:36.580
What's that sound?

17:41.580 --> 17:44.330
It's too dark, I can't see jack.

17:44.330 --> 17:47.740
Let me enhance my sight
with physical enhancement.

17:50.670 --> 17:52.090
What's wrong, Shea?

18:13.180 --> 18:15.260
Hajime, what is it?

18:15.260 --> 18:16.270
Hajime?

18:16.270 --> 18:18.870
Master, are you fine?

18:20.510 --> 18:21.790
A demon...

18:21.790 --> 18:23.340
A demon?

18:23.340 --> 18:26.150
It's a demon.
There's a demon below.

18:27.900 --> 18:31.720
Um, do you mean THAT demon?

18:32.170 --> 18:35.340
No, it's something even more sinister.

18:35.340 --> 18:37.760
It's even scarier
than an actual demon of hell.

18:38.350 --> 18:40.680
You guys know it as well.

18:42.860 --> 18:45.030
The demon of the kitchen.

18:53.490 --> 18:53.990
Whoa!

18:53.990 --> 18:56.990
- What is this?!
- There's a lot of C's!

18:56.990 --> 19:01.390
There are millions...
Wait, that's tens of millions!

19:01.920 --> 19:02.580
Hey!

19:02.950 --> 19:05.020
Hajime, let's burn them.

19:05.710 --> 19:09.110
Maybe we shouldn't.
I mean, look at their numbers.

19:09.110 --> 19:11.780
What if we miss a bunch,
and they come flying at us?

19:28.060 --> 19:29.560
Damn you!

19:32.270 --> 19:33.460
Draconic Thunder!

19:34.490 --> 19:37.860
No! Fly away!

19:38.650 --> 19:40.330
Dismantle! Dismantle!

19:40.330 --> 19:42.740
Get away from me!

19:42.740 --> 19:44.100
Come at me!

19:44.100 --> 19:46.290
C-C-Celestial Slash!

19:47.390 --> 19:48.710
Aeugh...

19:48.710 --> 19:53.920
'Tis be the holy ground!
No evil shall pass!

19:53.920 --> 19:55.630
Hallowed Ground!

20:08.500 --> 20:11.400
Suzu, don't faint!
You'll die if you're not awake!

20:11.760 --> 20:13.680
Our mental status, that is!

20:14.800 --> 20:17.630
Yue, put up some more defence.

20:17.630 --> 20:19.320
I won't let them through!

20:22.240 --> 20:26.330
We're always facing disasters
since we entered this Labyrinth!

20:26.330 --> 20:30.400
Just with the premise that
we have cleared other Labyrinths,

20:30.400 --> 20:33.540
perhaps the difficulty
is set higher with this one.

20:33.540 --> 20:36.990
Stop analysing things and do something!

20:36.990 --> 20:38.950
It's okay, Kaori.

20:39.950 --> 20:43.300
Not a problem.
They're just black sesame seeds.

20:43.300 --> 20:44.970
They're my favourite.

20:44.970 --> 20:46.770
- I love my food sprinkled with black sesame.
- Oh no!

20:46.770 --> 20:47.820
- I love my food sprinkled with black sesame.
- Shizuku's already broken!

20:47.820 --> 20:49.540
- Or even black sesame pudding.
- Shizuku's already broken!

20:49.540 --> 20:52.730
Shizuku!

21:04.060 --> 21:05.910
Hey, come on...

21:06.570 --> 21:09.520
They're forming a magic circle?!

21:25.070 --> 21:26.490
Like hell you would!

21:38.850 --> 21:40.610
What was that?

21:42.540 --> 21:43.520
Yue.

21:44.090 --> 21:45.030
Did something...

21:48.890 --> 21:49.690
Yue.

21:50.910 --> 21:52.120
Hajime.

21:53.040 --> 21:54.740
You know...

21:54.740 --> 21:57.050
I really hate you.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.590
As do I...

21:59.590 --> 22:01.700
I want to kill you so bad.

23:33.020 --> 23:34.010
GRAB HOLD OF HOPE

23:34.010 --> 23:37.010
GRAB HOLD OF HOPE
Next episode: Grab Hold of Hope.
